@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
@outletId = REPLACE_WITH_OUTLET_ID

### Exact-date insights from retained report rows (inclusive order dates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/zomato-sales-payout/insights/range?startDate=2026-10-28&endDate=2026-10-30
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{outletId}}

### Invalid range returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/zomato-sales-payout/insights/range?startDate=2026-11-02&endDate=2026-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{outletId}}

### Missing source coverage returns 409 with upload instructions
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/zomato-sales-payout/insights/range?startDate=2000-01-01&endDate=2000-01-02
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{outletId}}
